# The voice clone from source on Linux: its own venv with the voice pack's runner (the Windows pins without +cu128:
# PyPI's torch for Linux is the CUDA 12.8 build; CPU only: --extra-index-url https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cpu
# --index-strategy unsafe-best-match). README "Trying it from source (Linux)"; CI: .github/workflows/voice-pack.yml.
